    <link>https://savedmoments.github.io/savedmoments/articles/2026-08-20-1631.html</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://savedmoments.github.io/savedmoments/articles/2026-08-20-1631.html</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 16:31:32 +0800</pubDate>
    <author>半晌</author>
    <description>今年秋裤可能真的不用穿了，超强厄尔尼诺预计11至12月达峰值。台风雨水多、暖冬成定局，但极端天气更频繁。省下的秋裤钱，够买什么？</description>
